SSH key for Alpine APK publication

Generate a new key pair
  umask 077
  ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -N '' -C 'NAOS Alpine APK CI deploy' -f id_ed25519
  chmod 600 id_ed25519
  chmod 644 id_ed25519.pub

Record the repository server host public key in known_hosts using an existing
trusted connection to the server.
